==Spells==
Miraak knows the following spells and shouts:
* '''[[Skyrim:Destruction|Destruction]]''': [[Skyrim:Firebolt|Firebolt]], [[Skyrim:Sparks|Sparks]], [[Skyrim:Lightning Bolt|Lightning Bolt]], [[Skyrim:Chain Lightning|Chain Lightning]]
* '''[[Skyrim:Restoration|Restoration]]''': [[Skyrim:Healing|Healing]], [[Skyrim:Lesser Ward|Lesser Ward]], [[Skyrim:Fast Healing|Fast Healing]], [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]]
* '''[[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|Dragon Shouts]]''': [[Skyrim:Become Ethereal|Become Ethereal]], [[Skyrim:Cyclone|Cyclone]], [[Skyrim:Dragon Aspect|Dragon Aspect]], [[Skyrim:Fire Breath|Fire Breath]], [[Skyrim:Frost Breath|Frost Breath]], [[Skyrim:Unrelenting Force|Unrelenting Force]], [[Skyrim:Whirlwind Sprint|Whirlwind Sprint]]

Note that Miraak's shouts are customized and most have much shorter recovery times than the regular versions.

==Quest-Related Events==
===The Temple of Miraak===
[[File:SR-npc-Miraak 03.jpg|thumb|right|''"Who are you to dare set foot here?"'']]
Upon reading the [[Skyrim:Black Book: Waking Dreams (book)|Black Book: Waking Dreams]], you will be teleported to Apocrypha just in time to hear Miraak say 
:''"The time comes soon when..."'' 

Miraak will then acknowledge you by saying 
:''"What? Who are you to dare set foot here? Ahh... You are Dragonborn. I can feel it. And yet..."''

At this point his dialogue will differ depending on how many dragons you have slain.
